{"id":"636912","name":"鸡胸肉干丝","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/636912/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胸肉清洗干净后放入锅中，加入一勺料酒两片姜片煮熟。","img":"images/636912/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鸡胸肉撕成细丝。","img":"images/636912/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入一勺玉米油。","img":"images/636912/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入白砂糖和食盐。","img":"images/636912/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量黑胡椒粉。","img":"images/636912/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入番茄酱。","img":"images/636912/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/636912/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把鸡肉丝平铺在空气炸锅内。","img":"images/636912/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"°烤15分钟，中间记得打开多翻面几次，我的功率比较大120烤了15分钟。","img":"images/636912/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"完成。","img":"images/636912/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：空气炸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}